# Analysis and report (code, 2026-08-17)

`index_staging` walks staging except junk/dotfiles/`_backup`/any `_`-prefixed path part. Android recovery and iOS library **payloads** live outside `_` (`recovered_trash/`, `ios_hidden/`, …) and are indexed **only** if they appear in the verified manifest. Crawl artifacts join via `crawl_artifacts`+`crawl_records`. Upsert does not reset `analyzed`.

`analyze_session` order: crawl-record/SMS/contact JSON (0) → other text (1) → images including `visible_ui` (2) → video (3). `image_cap_*` default 0 = every indexed in-window image. Video QUICK cap 80. UI label is **Analisis**.

`analyze_content_result`: NudeNet 320n on images (L3) and sampled video frames (L4) **before** OCR bypasses. QUICK `source=gallery` skips EasyOCR unless chat/screenshot path. `visible_ui` screenshots reuse host OCR — do not run EasyOCR again. Host OCR enrichments are **Instagram-only** (`social_ocr.INSTAGRAM_PACKAGE`). Hash-cache fingerprint **v14**; detector / missing ffmpeg = **non-cacheable** (never store false-clean). Lab: `SADT_OCR_ENABLED=1`, `SADT_OCR_GPU=0` implies concurrency 1.

Live ingestion may publish findings while status is still `ACQUIRING` (during `_select`, after inventory). Transfer then replaces staging; already-analyzed DB rows stay `analyzed=1`.

Findings vs social: keyword/OCR/nudity → findings + recommendation. Own-account social is **report data** (`_social_report_data` from `visible_ui` crawl records), auto-selected even without keywords, not converted to findings. Crawl JSON **can** still emit L1/L2 keyword findings.

`reports._social_report_data`: prefer `metadata.profile_username`; reject sentinels (`null`, metrics, `Search.Facebook`, `on.your`). FB without vanity handle → display name only. `friends` is its own metric; do not fold into `followers`. Do not emit bio when it equals display name. `own_profile` is account header, not an item row.

Recommendation: confirmed → `TIDAK LULUS`; pending → `MENUNGGU REVIEW`; else `LULUS`. Authorize stays blocked while pending.

Dashboard/report source labels exist for recovered trash / iOS hidden-deleted-cache. Additive progress fields only; `SessionProgress` extra="allow".
